-bound by `Real.sum_le_exp_of_nonneg` (`taylor_fst_le`); its error bound gives an upper bound by
-`Real.exp_bound` for the tail after `m ≥ 1` terms, `|Y|^m (m+1)/(m!·m) ≤ 2 Y^m/m!` for `|Y| ≤ 1`
